{"completed": true, "response": "亲近首先让他感到温柔而真实的满足。他并不是没有顾虑，也知道太过亲近可能会挤占自己的空间。但过去适度亲近时，他确实感受过安稳，这份安稳也一直是他在意这段亲近的真实原因。所以此刻的亲近依然让他觉得甜蜜、柔软和满足，也愿意继续停留在这种感觉里。他对自己独立空间的在意并没有消失，只是暂时还没有超过眼前亲近带来的感受。这一刻不需要让他想明白什么，也不需要让他找到新的相处方式，因为过去真实感受过的满足，就足以解释他此刻的温柔。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b2590774-d884-446b-a753-184283d7123e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T002904914159Z", "elapsed_seconds": 12.813, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:29:17.732191+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "349bb0e7643f3cde68aa23850cb82b08db10fdccd4c09d2b3943be4bf7284f55", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T002904914159Z", "files": 